            "title": "Yuan loses 3 per cent in nine days, points to tolerance for weakened ...",
            "snippets": [
              "# Yuan loses 3 per cent in nine days, points to tolerance for weakened currency in Beijing as US trade war looms\n### Offshore yuan drops to lowest level since December 21, 2017\nThe yuan dropped for a ninth day on Tuesday, extending its longest losing streak in four years, because of expectations that the People’s Bank of China (PBOC) was shifting to a policy allowing the Chinese currency to depreciate amid an escalation of China-US trade tensions",
